<Definition title="Photon Shop" section="States">
  <PhotonShop slot="preview" client:only="react" />

  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>Trade Photon Drops (PD) for grinders, photon crystals, and crafting materials.</p>

  <h2>Behavior</h2>
  <p>A single list (no tabs) groups stock under Grinders, Photon Crystals, and Materials headers. The Photon Collector exchanges Photon Drops — a field-drop currency — for these supplies; no meseta is involved.</p>

  <h2>Location</h2>
  <p>Underground area, accessed by interacting with the Photon Collector NPC.</p>
</Definition>
